Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们的错  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did this, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们闯的祸  我们兜着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We broke it, we bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我释放了一股能摧毁一切的力量到这世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I unleashed a force on this world that could destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道是我们放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that we set her free,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就得把她关回去  不管付出什么代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna put her back in, no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.47,0:00:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了创造世界  上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to create the world, God,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能放弃黑暗  他的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had to betray the darkness -- his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未来  我们是紧密相连的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future. We're bonded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是释放了我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那只是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.15,0:00:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不可抗拒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be resisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.03,0:01:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱里有个笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this cage in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法被关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's where they keep Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾被关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've been in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝好像想让我回到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think God wants me to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好有男人味啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入你头脑的并不是上帝  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't God inside your head, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从未与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never been with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我的确是你唯一的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I am your only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.69,0:01:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就住下吧  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle in there, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  妈妈  我收到个萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Mom, I got a Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.22,0:01:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you, dearie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.65,0:02:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我带来了什么  你给我带来了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you bring me? What'd you bring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.71,0:02:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看圣诞老人给你带了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what santa got for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个乖孩子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧  罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Rowena?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就梦这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you dream about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是反复出现的噩梦差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more of a recurring nightmare, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这东西摘不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}These don't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这梦我已经做了几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been having this dream for months,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.47,0:02:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're new.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  抱歉  我的礼貌有点生疏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sorry, ‭my manners are a bit rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.37,0:03:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第10集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,厉害吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Rowena?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她只是听命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did as she was told.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,粉丝啊  总那么急切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Groupies... they're always so eager.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you did all of that just to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就为了要我的身体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what? Jump my bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你白费功夫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wasted your time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这事会怎么结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, see, I know how this ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, do you, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:04:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你戏弄我  折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll taunt me, and you'll torture me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll say no,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终  比你想得要早\N{\fnArial\fs30}and eventually, sooner than you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥会走进来  揍扁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother's gonna walk through that door and kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要把注压在迪恩身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're betting on Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你猜错我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sam, you got me all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我并不打算折磨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I-I'm not here to torture ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是可以那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以给你痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could inflict pain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法想象的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭like you can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could inflict such delicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,痛不欲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}perfect pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那是五年前的我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was so five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不会伤你一根\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not gonna harm a glorious little hair
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的汗毛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on that glorious little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提出一个你不忍拒绝的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make you an offer you can't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:05:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧  萨姆  你需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Sam, you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会证明给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recognize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在一段记忆中  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a memory, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你童年为数不多的一段好记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the few good ones from your childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我还觉得自己有恋父情结呢  可你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I thought I had daddy issues, but you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之  你应该能认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I think you recognize
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个帅气年轻的小伙子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dashing young beanpole over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  费格斯  少放空话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Fergus, enough with idle threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你背叛了我  还是在我的王国里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed me... in my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的  是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yours, his!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell is his!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你伤了我  你觉得他会怎么整你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hurt me, and what do you think he'll do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法永远别想出牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer will never get out of that cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿拿性命打赌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you willing to stake your life on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把注压在萨姆·温彻斯特身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Sam Winchester?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为他卖命多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been working for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法给我托了梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer came to me in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那种梦啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that kind of dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就打算让大猛男指使你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're just gonna let the big, strong man boss you around?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那个超屌巫师团呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened to the super-duper awesome coven?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有女生力量呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girlpower?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法不是凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's no man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我为什么让你的狗腿子找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I let your droogs find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法有个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer has a plan, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得好像那是坏事似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like it's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才是坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是最糟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a worse thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法上次去人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time Lucifer went topside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道他想做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you know what he wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡  你死  我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death for you, for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人  每个恶魔都死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and every human, and every demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只不过需要一个死三八爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he needed was the love of a horrible woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做这些  是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, and you're doing all this, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出于好心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the goodness of your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be daft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法阻止了黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Lucifer stops the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会升入天堂  坐上王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll ascend to his throne in heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会伴在他身侧  作为忠诚追随者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll be by his side, a loyal follower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王后吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你喜欢不喜欢  你知道我说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, you know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法以前跟黑暗斗过  他赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer fought the Darkness before, and he won.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非  你兜里揣着上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, unless you've got the almighty in your back pocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是坐下  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you sit down, shut up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let him work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆不能接听  他在除毛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam can't talk 'cause he's waxing, like, everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-留言吧  -哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but leave a message and... - Dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿我手机做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you doing with my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打给我  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me... now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢致电克劳力  地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for phoning Crowley, King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔交易  请按1\N{\fnArial\fs30}For demon deals, press 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,报告目击红发贱婊罗威娜  请按2\N{\fnArial\fs30}To report a sighting of that ginger whore, Rowena, press 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一喊我我就赶来了  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came as soon as you called. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.86,0:09:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-把舌头伸出来  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stick out your tongue. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完事没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你测测体温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take your temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别指望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离事发地有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far are we from the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-天使核弹吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean the angel nuke? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原爆点是那个方向一英里远左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground zero's about a mile down that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是患了毁灭晕眩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're suffering from smiting sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-还有这玩意  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a thing? ‭- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天使所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels, what they did,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,释放了很大量的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}it released a tremendous amount of energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是有后果的  这一整片区域都受到了毒害\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's fallout, so this whole area is poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.35,0:09:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能治好我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can heal me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你越靠近原爆点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the closer you get to the blast site,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.25,0:10:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的晕眩越会加剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the worse your sickness will become.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到什么程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}How worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次发生这种程度的毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time there was a smiting of this magnitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.55,0:10:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗德之妻变成了盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot's wife turned to salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.03,0:10:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  迪恩  你得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Dean, you need to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我们得去看看是不是成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, we got to... ‭we got to go see if it worked,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看阿玛拉是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if Amara is alive or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我们"不用去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个后果对天使没影响  我自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fallout doesn't affect angels. I'll go in alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那样或许更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah, it's... ‭it's probably better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开车去看看萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take a drive. I'll go check on Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真好使了  她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it did work, and she is dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把她的尸体带出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her body out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她没死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if she's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿芝特克祭司\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the Aztec priests,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以为如果不进行人祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}they thought if they didn't sacrifice people,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界就会终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole world would end,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们建造了好多庙宇\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they built all of these temples.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最棒的一个在墨西哥城\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most amazing ones are in Mexico City.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去看过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去年  我爸带我和我哥去了墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last year, my dad took me and my brother on a trip to Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去度假吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是工作度假吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a working vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道卓柏卡布拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever heard of a Chupacabra?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,边远小镇的单纯女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple girl from a one-stop-light town,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你呢  见过世面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you, the worldly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还算帅气的萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}handsome-ish Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她根本毫无机会  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she didn't stand a chance. You remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你为什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了  嘘  这段最精彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Shh, shh, shh. This is the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我带你来这儿不是为了学习吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I didn't bring you here to study, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:12:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是吗  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't? - ‭No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, I just think that you're smart
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.19,0:12:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很风趣  很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and funny and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果...你想亲热一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I mean, if you want to make out...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about right there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接吻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kissing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我记忆里的那个萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Sam Winchester that I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大胆  果决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bold, decisive,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舌吻技能良\N{\fnArial\fs30}solid "B" on the tongue action.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.50,0:12:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前是个英雄  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to be a hero, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还打败过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我看着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I look at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都认不出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even recognize you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:12:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想你  小布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss you, too, puddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪  萨姆在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? Where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出了点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bit of a hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟跟路西法一起在地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's in hell with Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(斯塔尔墓地)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔尔墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stull cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世纪大战发生的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the title fight went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass-butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混球  我到现在也不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass-butt? ‭I-I-I-I still don't get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你带我回忆过去  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I appreciate the stroll down memory lane, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我有说过我多么敬重你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, have I ever told you how much I respect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:13:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别误会  我并不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't get me wrong. I don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没喜欢过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never liked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.11,0:14:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太...谨小慎微了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're... you're sort of prissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你跟我正面对决  还赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you stood toe-to-toe with me and won,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  你真有种  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say, you had balls, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我控制住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意为拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were willing to do the hard thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做出艰难的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it meant saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在已经不是那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你心软了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gone soft, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安布里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在天堂做生死统计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work in birth/death statistics in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm an... I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是卡西迪奥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听过好多你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard stories about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你的原因一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same reason you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.77,0:15:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂想知道黑暗是否已经被消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven wants to know if ‭the Darkness has been destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们派你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要杀我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就这么说吗  我杀天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what they say, that I kill angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这算是最客气的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the nicest thing they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以合作  谁都不用杀谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can work together, so no one murders anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:15:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.18,0:16:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我已经搜过东边的林子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so I've searched the east end of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.35,0:16:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.62,0:16:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道现在是大下午吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it is ‭the middle of the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  为什么这么黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... Why is it dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.01,0:16:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我知道你在干正经事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass, I know you're fighting the good fight right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你来内布拉斯加州肯纳索\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need you at 3rd and Pine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第三大道和派恩街口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenesaw, Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, uh, I'm going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Password.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力叫我来的  赶紧开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley sent me, all right? Just open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Password.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:16:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*坎普顿的妹子唱起来*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Camptown ladies sing this song*
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*嘟嘟哒*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Doo dah, doo dah*
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*坎普顿的跑道五英里长*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Camptown racetrack five miles long*
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,*嘟嘟哒  嘟嘟迪*  快让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Oh, the doo-dah day* All right, just let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唱得好  比伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Bieber.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个恶魔还挺幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny for a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.39,0:17:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是恶魔  我叫比莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a demon. Name's Billie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死神比莉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reaper Billie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟说你想杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother says you want to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要确保等你们死了  不会再活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna make sure that when you die, you stay dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些区别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subtle difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你为克劳力工作了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you work for Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是合作  不是为他工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}With, not for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在世道不好  温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strange days, Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让国王欠你个人情没什么不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't hurt to have the king owe you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给那英国佬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the limey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是什么  -你会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - ‭You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.69,0:18:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送我去我该去的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just get me to where I need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路可长呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想好你要跟他说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought about what you're gonna say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:18:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想过了  我好好想过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought about it, and I've thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我还是不知道  -一切都在这儿改变了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I still don't know. - Here's where it all changed, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好不真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just all so surreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你做过的最糟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the worst thing you've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道他们告诉你他是行动中牺牲的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he know they told you he was killed in action?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦事件之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the leviathans,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥被困在炼狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your brother was trapped in purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你却在这儿泡妞  逗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were here with a girl and a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本没努力去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't even bother trying to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.13,0:19:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我虽然不用向你证明什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Not that I have to defend myself to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但迪恩和我说好我们不会再去找彼此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Dean and I promised we wouldn't look for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  如果他之后也没回来就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, and if he never came back, you'd be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他回来了  所以有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he did, so you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个大胆  果决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened to the Sam Winchester
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甘为大局牺牲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was bold, decisive,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ready to sacrifice for the greater good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-就在这儿  -那你为什么听了迪恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right here. - ‭And so why did you let Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有关闭地狱大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk you out of closing the gates of hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前的萨姆可不会那么做  绝不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the old Sam never would've done that, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我没...  -等等  这个我最喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't... ‭- No, wait, ‭here's my personal favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.28,0:19:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为了祛除血印做尽了蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}is you doing every stupid thing you could to cure the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即便你知道不会有好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}even after you knew it would go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你为了救他不惜一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and you'd do anything to save him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:19:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也会为救你不惜一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he'd do anything to save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that is the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这个  因为你太过愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of this, ‭you're so overcome by guilt
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法忍受再次失去迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you can't stand to lose Dean again,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他更是不愿失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he could never lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们不选择世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so instead of choosing the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是选择彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}you choose each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管多少无辜者会为此死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how many innocent people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.01,0:20:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要在伤害他人这事上教训我吗  就你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna lecture me about hurting people? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我说得对  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm right, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  如果你想击败黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that if you're gonna beat the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须准备赴死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to be ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得准备好看着你所爱的人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be ready to watch the people you love die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前  你是能为大业战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time ago, you could've fought the good fight, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.31,0:20:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢不了了  萨姆  你不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win this one, Sam. You're just not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人挣钱是我的本行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, snapping necks and cashing checks... that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这多好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起度过美好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spending quality time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您的茶泡好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tea is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可算好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.23,0:21:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听上去是很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does sound lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您要什么样的茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.99,0:21:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加蜂蜜和一点牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey and a splash of milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有其母必有其子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like mother, like son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得去吐一吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点回来  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry back, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不希望如此  被我同类仇视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted this, you know, to be hated by my own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不  我不恨你  卡西迪奥  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, I don't hate you, Castiel. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.31,0:21:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有很多共同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, ‭we have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的名字押韵  这是一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our names rhyme, and that's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我穿风衣也很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look good in a trench coat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们都可有可无\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're both expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才被派来  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, that's why we're here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个查数的  你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a number cruncher, and... and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.37,0:22:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  我听过好多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, I've heard the stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.58,0:22:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特才是真英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Sam and Dean Winchester are the real heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果黑暗还活着  她肯定很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if the Darkness is still alive, and she's pissed,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.71,0:22:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了我们  也无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she kills us, no big loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  或许我们并不那么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, sure, maybe ‭we're not super important,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.21,0:22:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们能完成工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这还是值得尊敬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's nobility in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.44,0:22:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.14,0:23:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆呢  -别担心萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Sam? - Oh, don't worry about Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.11,0:23:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你认识我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. Have you met me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.29,0:23:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法需要小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, ‭Lucifer needs the moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.09,0:23:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会杀他...的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna kill him... probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对抗魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You versus the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  有更轻松的自杀方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, there's easier ways of committing suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.69,0:23:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得专注对付罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to focus on Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  我们杀了她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great, let's kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.80,0:23:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕说的容易做的难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, easier said than done, I'm afraid,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们需要母亲把魔鬼关回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we need mother to slam the devil back in his hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.81,0:23:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会配合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is she gonna play ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.40,0:23:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这叫女巫捕手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a witchcatcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.26,0:23:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分在宗教法庭后被毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of them were destroyed after the inquisition,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.53,0:23:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但比莉还是找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, Billie came through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  她可讨喜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she's a peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.52,0:23:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这东西干嘛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.66,0:24:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安布里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Ambriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.69,0:25:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对她做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吃了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I consumed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.42,0:25:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的能量  她的火花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her grace, her spark,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.41,0:25:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的记忆  一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}her memories... everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.90,0:25:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.98,0:25:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真是恰到好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she really hit the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.58,0:25:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂重拳出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, heaven brought the thunder,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都没怎么擦破我的皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it barely even scratched my paint job,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.94,0:25:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你拿着一把小尖刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you and a shiny knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.39,0:25:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  肯定有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, that's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:25:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我怕死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm afraid to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.21,0:26:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你怕死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.53,0:26:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一股恐惧和自我厌恶的味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reek of fear and self-loathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.48,0:26:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吓人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.71,0:26:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.75,0:26:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是可有可无\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are expendable...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.97,0:26:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝为什么那么青睐你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why God took ‭a special interest in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.23,0:26:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真是无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.26,0:26:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥一向不会看人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother always did have horrible taste in men.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.43,0:26:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都不值得我浪费力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't even worth the effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.75,0:26:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯  但你看上去有点累\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, no offense, ‭but you look a bit used up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.14,0:26:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.08,0:26:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事需要你做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.18,0:27:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.17,0:27:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little tip, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.11,0:27:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你下次去制定秘密计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next time you go about making secret plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.68,0:27:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先看下口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}check your pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.56,0:27:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得去吐一吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.04,0:27:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点回来  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry back, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.03,0:27:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.83,0:27:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.03,0:28:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.05,0:28:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean, big boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.42,0:28:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little tip, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.34,0:28:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别喝讨厌你的人给你的茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never accept a cup of tea from someone who loathes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.44,0:28:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把这东西拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this bloody thing off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.06,0:28:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒想  但是这东西能让你做我的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I would, but this bloody thing makes you my slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,单脚跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop on one foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.37,0:28:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了  费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Fergus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.39,0:28:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你以为你在玩什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what kind of oedipal fifty shades
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.51,0:28:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变态的恋母游戏  但你如果以为我会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think you're playing at, but if you think for a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.57,0:28:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.73,0:28:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.18,0:28:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.46,0:28:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这些一时不好接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is a lot to take in,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.83,0:28:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you need to
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.41,0:29:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花点时间去想想  也没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}take some time and noodle on it, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.69,0:29:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  世界在终结啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, the world is ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.01,0:29:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗  时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}clock ticking and such if you follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.78,0:29:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y开头ES结尾的那个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little word, uh, starts with "Y," Ends in "E-s""
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.85,0:29:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you don't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.12,0:29:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂的  我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.35,0:29:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有时候也不喜欢自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I don't like me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.97,0:29:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但加百列和拉斐尔已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Gabriel and Raphael are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.00,0:29:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝出去抽了包烟就再也没回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God went out for a pack ‭of smokes and never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.08,0:29:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.38,0:29:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just say
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.91,0:29:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,监狱生活并不是很适合米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}prison life hasn't really agreed with Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.02,0:29:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些日子  他一般就坐在角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}These days, he's usually sitting in a corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.02,0:29:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唱唱小曲儿以及...自慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}singing show tunes and...touching himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.01,0:29:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以只有你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.91,0:29:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.71,0:29:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.16,0:29:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是什么好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm not the good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.71,0:29:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we both know I'm not,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.06,0:30:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.84,0:30:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她可是万物的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the end of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.62,0:30:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以打败她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.99,0:30:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以打败她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.96,0:30:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.55,0:30:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.05,0:30:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  来吧  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.90,0:30:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做出正确的选择吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.59,0:30:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再做一次巨大的牺牲  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big sacrifice one more time, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.77,0:30:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.99,0:30:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该去拯救世界了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to save the world, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.92,0:30:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.35,0:30:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.67,0:30:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个能把路西法丢回笼子里的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this spell is supposed to slam Lucifer back in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.68,0:30:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要多久能好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long's this gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.44,0:30:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大约五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}About five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.43,0:30:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非萨姆同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless Sam says yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.29,0:31:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如他同意了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he does?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.27,0:31:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如路西法找到了一具皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer finds a vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.99,0:31:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就能在人间扎根了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll be anchored to earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咒语就起不了作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The incantation won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.16,0:31:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.44,0:31:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  陛下  我尽力...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, my lord. I tried to --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.99,0:31:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.42,0:31:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒  天使来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good, the angel's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.79,0:31:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉  她还...活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, she's -- she's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.97,0:31:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}She --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.95,0:31:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她稍来了这条口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}she sent this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.91,0:31:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我要来了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am coming"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.29,0:31:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是威胁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.33,0:31:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.32,0:31:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说"不"是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见我说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.59,0:31:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.33,0:31:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你  这太自私了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you, this is selfish, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.92,0:31:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-一切都...  -你完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything that -- - You are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.37,0:31:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.14,0:31:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.76,0:31:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你嘴皮子功夫很好  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk a good game. You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.19,0:31:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有几次你都差点把我说动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you almost had me sold a few times,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.25,0:31:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但之后我一想  假如你是对的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then I thought, what if you're right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.22,0:31:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如你说的是实话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you're telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.09,0:32:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如你能打败她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What -- what if you can beat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.39,0:32:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.48,0:32:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但上一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though, last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.08,0:32:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打败她的是你加上另外三个大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}it took you ‭plus three other archangels.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.11,0:32:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  还有上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, and capital "G," God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.16,0:32:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你是说那个拖后腿的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay, what, ‭you mean the dead weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.65,0:32:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但就算你搞定了她  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's say you gank her. Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.30,0:32:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搬到洛杉矶  破案去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I move to L.A., solve crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.04,0:32:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.93,0:32:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就要重新发动天启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you go about starting the apocalypse again
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.09,0:32:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是个老油条\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're an old dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.17,0:32:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而那是你的老把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's your old trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.37,0:32:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  你不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, first off, you don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.01,0:32:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其次  就算我那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second, even if I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.25,0:32:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那也比她打算做的事好\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's better ‭than what she has planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.33,0:32:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.14,0:32:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.41,0:32:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是这么觉得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this is what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.07,0:32:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得无论是谁赢  你还是黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that whoever wins, you or the darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人都是输\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone else loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.51,0:32:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.62,0:32:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的答案是"不"\N{\fnArial\fs30}My answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.69,0:32:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是因为迪恩或者...过去的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't 'cause of Dean or -- or the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.01,0:32:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是因为我对我的朋友们  亲人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about me ‭having faith in my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.87,0:33:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}having faith in my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.28,0:33:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到解决办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.54,0:33:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好赴死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.85,0:33:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也准备好看着我爱的人死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm ready to watch people I love die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.16,0:33:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不打算当你的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not ready to be your bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.24,0:33:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.08,0:33:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.00,0:33:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.97,0:33:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.70,0:33:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ass-butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.58,0:33:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.43,0:33:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.97,0:34:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.05,0:34:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.02,0:34:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样的时刻  气氛是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moments like this, it's all about ambience.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.97,0:34:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以打败黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can beat the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.53,0:34:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这两人算什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these two?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.82,0:34:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他俩就是大猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a couple of apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.83,0:34:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是对的  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm right, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.39,0:34:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.00,0:34:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想那样玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to play that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.35,0:34:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们赢不了的  -我们不用赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't win. - We don't have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.65,0:34:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需要撑几分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've just got to last a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.68,0:35:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你出手像个人类似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit like a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.11,0:35:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.64,0:35:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你很好选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make this real easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.24,0:35:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么说出那个"好"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say the magic word...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.50,0:35:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么你哥哥就死\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or your brother dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.70,0:35:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道你不会看着他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we both know you won't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.58,0:36:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.21,0:36:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  有遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? Last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.10,0:36:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.70,0:36:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.44,0:36:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不说你咬我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.45,0:36:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以让她咬你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make her do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.51,0:36:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.23,0:36:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于黑暗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.31,0:36:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.66,0:37:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们会想到办法的  -或者尖叫着死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll figure it out. - Or die screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.67,0:37:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是一场灾难  现在都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has been a horrible train wreck, so we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.93,0:37:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,组合  结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team-up over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.69,0:37:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.81,0:37:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stays.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.74,0:37:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们其他人  滚出地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you lot, get the hell out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.38,0:37:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.93,0:37:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.29,0:37:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.84,0:37:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我送你一程吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want me to give you a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.73,0:37:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用  你们俩先走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you two go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.33,0:37:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.20,0:37:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.68,0:38:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.76,0:38:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天够呛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.48,0:38:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.02,0:38:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.65,0:38:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.47,0:38:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果路西法说的是真的怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if Lucifer was telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.14,0:38:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-如果他  -不  老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, what if he's the -- - No, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.55,0:38:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗是糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.72,0:38:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她加上魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her and the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.77,0:38:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.10,0:38:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.86,0:38:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.50,0:38:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨你  是因为当我看着你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you because when I look into your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.08,0:38:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了曾经的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the woman I used to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.79,0:38:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在没有魔法  巫师团之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before magic, before the coven,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.00,0:38:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还什么都不是  只是革匠的女儿罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was nothing but Rowena, the tanner's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.79,0:39:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个苍白  胆怯的小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pale, scared, little girl
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.46,0:39:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,散发着污秽和死亡的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}who smelled of filth and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.27,0:39:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.52,0:39:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你出生时\N{\fnArial\fs30}because when you were born,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.12,0:39:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲说他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}your father said he loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.23,0:39:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他回到了他奢华的家中  他正妻身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he went back to his grand wife and his grand house
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.98,0:39:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我则可怜地半死不活地躺在草垫上\N{\fnArial\fs30}whilst I lay pathetic ‭and half-dead on a straw mat,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.57,0:39:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的大腿沾满鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}my thighs slick with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.47,0:39:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.45,0:39:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果我不恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.60,0:39:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.50,0:39:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是爱  爱是弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But love -- love is weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.90,0:39:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远不要再脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll never be weak again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.47,0:39:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.06,0:40:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.59,0:40:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.94,0:40:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.64,0:40:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的能打败她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you really beat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.94,0:40:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我可以  -那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can. - ‭Then, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.99,0:40:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.48,0:40:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.12,0:40:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能  你念完了咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be. You finished the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.23,0:40:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果他已经在另一个皮囊里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he was already in another vessel...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.59,0:40:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loophole.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.01,0:40:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.31,0:40:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.15,0:40:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.14,0:40:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.63,0:40:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为我做的  我永远不会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you've done for me, I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.35,0:40:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}'twas my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.04,0:40:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.72,0:40:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.03,0:40:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你理应得到奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.91,0:41:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是  我恩宠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or some little token...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.21,0:41:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小小表示\N{\fnArial\fs30}of my affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.91,0:41:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.32,0:41:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one teensy, tiny little question.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.27,0:41:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有别人能打开笼子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anyone else open the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.79,0:41:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.74,0:41:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.95,0:41:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.96,0:41:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们聊聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's chat.

